tion": 37.325, "size_bytes": 224928, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 101, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/80/en_a1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/80/en_a1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 32.549, "size_bytes": 196272, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 101, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/80/en_a1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/80/en_a1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 34.575, "size_bytes": 208368, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 101, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/80/en_a1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@42e9725/content/data/versions/791.json", "paragraphs": ["Rokid Glasses 2 costs 3699 yuan. It has a camera and four microphones. It can translate calls in 89 languages. It also writes meeting notes for you.", "Rokid Color has a full-color screen. It weighs 55 grams. It shows maps, photos and videos. The Rokid Ring costs 1699 yuan. You can slide and tap it.", "The ring also checks your heart rate and sleep. Rokid says 45,000 developers now work on its platform.", "Rokid also started a contest for developers. The prize money is 5 million yuan."], "paragraphs_zh": ["Rokid Glasses 2售价3699元。它配有摄像头和四个麦克风，支持89种语言的通话翻译，还能帮你写会议纪要。", "Rokid Color有一块全彩屏幕，重55克，可以显示地图、照片和视频。Rokid Ring售价1699元，支持滑动和点击操作。", "这枚戒指还能监测心率和睡眠。乐奇表示，目前已有4.5万名开发者在它的平台上工作。", "乐奇还启动了一项开发者比赛，奖金总额为500万元。"], "body": "Rokid Glasses 2 costs 3699 yuan. It has a camera and four microphones. It can translate calls in 89 languages. It also writes meeting notes for you.\n\nRokid Color has a full-color screen. It weighs 55 grams. It shows maps, photos and videos. The Rokid Ring costs 1699 yuan. You can slide and tap it.\n\nThe ring also checks your heart rate and sleep. Rokid says 45,000 developers now work on its platform.\n\nRokid also started a contest for developers. The prize money is 5 million yuan.", "body_zh": "Rokid Glasses 2售价3699元。它配有摄像头和四个麦克风，支持89种语言的通话翻译，还能帮你写会议纪要。\n\nRokid Color有一块全彩屏幕，重55克，可以显示地图、照片和视频。Rokid Ring售价1699元，支持滑动和点击操作。\n\n这枚戒指还能监测心率和睡眠。乐奇表示，目前已有4.5万名开发者在它的平台上工作。\n\n乐奇还启动了一项开发者比赛，奖金总额为500万元。", "text": "Rokid Glasses 2 costs 3699 yuan. It has a camera and four microphones. It can translate calls in 89 languages. It also writes meeting notes for you. Rokid Color has a full-color screen. It weighs 55 grams. It shows maps, photos and videos. The Rokid Ring costs 1699 yuan. You can slide and tap it. The ring also checks your heart rate and sleep. Rokid says 45,000 developers now work on its platform. Rokid also started a contest for developers. The prize money is 5 million yuan.", "vocab": [{"word": "launch", "pos": "verb", "zh": "发布；推出", "note": "常用来说新产品上市", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "glasses", "pos": "noun", "zh": "眼镜", "note": "复数形式，一副眼镜用a pair of glasses", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "ring", "pos": "noun", "zh": "戒指", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "cost", "pos": "verb", "zh": "花费；售价", "note": "It costs 3699 yuan.", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "camera", "pos": "noun", "zh": "摄像头", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "translate", "pos": "verb", "zh": "翻译", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "screen", "pos": "noun", "zh": "屏幕", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "developer", "pos": "noun", "zh": "开发者", "note": "指为平台做软件的人", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-10-28T00:40:07.973088", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "Rokid", "s": 0.325, "e": 0.675, "sm": 325, "em": 675, "cs": 0, "ce": 5, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "Glasses", "s": 0.675, "e": 1.137, "sm": 675, "em": 1137, "cs": 6, "ce": 13, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "2", "s": 1.137, "e": 1.35, "sm": 1137, "em": 1349, "cs": 14, "ce": 15,